  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Liger.jpg\" title=\"The Liger\"><img alt=\"The Liger\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"167\" src=\"/images/Liger.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Liger.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>The Liger</div></div></div><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:302px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Liger_henchman.jpg\" title=\"Liger Henchman\"><img alt=\"Liger Henchman\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"169\" src=\"/images/Liger_henchman.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Liger_henchman.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Liger Henchman</div></div></div>\n<p>The Liger is found running through the forest in <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Purpose-Pondering Peak</a>.  He is a benign NPC.  On completion of the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Eye_of_the_Liger\" title=\"Eye of the Liger\">Eye of the Liger</a> he can become a henchman.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
